OL,3,AHomes evacuated over fire-damaged hotel
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near to a fire-damaged
OL,7,Fseaside hotel in Folkestone have been
OL,8,Fevacuated over safety fears that the
OL,9,Fintensity of the basement blaze
OL,10,Fweakened the building's structure, the
OL,11,Fcouncil has said.
OL,13,FThe blaze broke out at the Grand
OL,14,FBurstin Hotel in Marine Parade in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of Saturday, with about 280
OL,16,Fpeople evacuated.
OL,18,FFolkestone and Hythe District Council
OL,19,Fsaid 90 people were relocated from
OL,20,FPavilion Court in Marine Terrace
OL,21,Ffollowing concerns raised by safety
OL,22,Finspectors.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
